	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnNormSInv,	L"NORMSINV"
	dxSpreadSheetFunctionsStrs_sfnNormSInvDescription,	L"Iteratively calculates the inverse of the standard normal cumulative distribution. The standard distribution\xfffds arithmetic mean and standard deviation are 0 and 1, respectively."
